---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
const updated = 'November 20, 2026';
---
<PageLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="How SkillSprint handles your information: game results are stored locally in your browser and are not uploaded."
  heading="Privacy Policy"
  lead={`Last updated: ${updated}`}
  narrow
>
  <p>This policy explains what information SkillSprint (“we”, “the site”) handles when you use it. We have tried to keep it short and accurate. If our practices change, we will update this page and the date above.</p>

  <h2>Information stored on your device</h2>
  <p>SkillSprint does not have user accounts. To remember your progress, the site uses your browser’s <strong>local storage</strong> to save, on your own device:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>personal best scores and a history of recent game results;</li>
    <li>daily challenge results and streaks;</li>
    <li>game settings you choose (for example, test duration or difficulty);</li>
    <li>your light or dark theme preference.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>This information is created and read by the site’s code running in your browser. <strong>It is not sent to our servers.</strong> It is not synchronised between devices or browsers. You can delete it at any time with the “Reset all data” button on the <a href="/stats/">statistics page</a>, or by clearing your browser’s site data.</p>

  <h2>Information we do not collect</h2>
  <p>We do not ask for your name, email address or other contact details to play. SkillSprint does not currently use analytics or advertising cookies, and the site’s fonts, flags and map data are served from our own website rather than third-party services.</p>

  <h2>Server and hosting logs</h2>
  <p>Like most websites, the service that hosts SkillSprint may automatically record technical information when your browser requests a page — such as your IP address, browser type, the page requested and the time of the request — for security and to keep the service running. How long these logs are kept depends on the hosting provider.</p>

  <h2>Advertising</h2>
  <p>SkillSprint does not currently show advertisements. The site has been designed so that advertising (such as Google AdSense) may be added in the future to keep it free. Before any advertising is enabled we will update this policy to describe the advertising partners, the cookies or similar technologies they may use, and any choices available to you, including consent where required.</p>

  <h2>Links to other websites</h2>
  <p>Some pages link to other websites (for example, the sources of our flag and map data). Those sites have their own privacy practices.</p>

  <h2>Children</h2>
  <p>SkillSprint is a general-audience website and does not knowingly collect personal information from anyone, including children.</p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>Questions about this policy can be sent using the details on our <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>.</p>
</PageLayout>
